{"title": "Arming Enhancement", "pageid": 28660, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Arming_Enhancement", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Arming Enhancement</b> is a passive feature that adds a straight +2 enchantment to your current weapon.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Gain a +2 Bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> rolls with weapons. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legacy_of_the_Masters\" title=\"Legacy of the Masters\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Gloves_Metal_C_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Metal_C_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Gloves_Metal_C_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Gloves_Metal_C_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Gloves_Metal_C_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Gloves_Metal_C_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Gloves_Metal_C_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Metal_C_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/16/Gloves_Metal_C_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Legacy_of_the_Masters\" title=\"Legacy of the Masters\">Legacy of the Masters</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The +2 bonus to attack rolls granted by Arming Enhancement also affects spell attacks, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unarmed_Strike\" title=\"Unarmed Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/20px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/30px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unarmed Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/20px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unarmed_Strike\" title=\"Unarmed Strike\">Unarmed Strikes</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/30px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/40px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a> attacks; however, those attacks do not receive the +2 damage, except for Throw attacks using weapons with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/25px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/38px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/50px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thrown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/25px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\">Thrown</a> property.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195004\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1493/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11594/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4064/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 968111/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.610      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   39.610      1 -total\n 43.27%   17.139      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 38.41%   15.216      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 36.05%   14.278      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 19.29%    7.642      1 Template:Item_icon\n 14.59%    5.780      2 Template:SmSAI\n 12.99%    5.146      3 Template:Icon_link\n 11.89%    4.708      3 Template:Icon_text\n 11.18%    4.427     12 Template:Trim\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28660-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195004 and revision id 393648. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</di